{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}AC13.02 – Read, execute, debug and modify a program{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <div class="container">

        <h1>AC13.02 – Read, execute, debug and modify a program</h1>

        <p>
            <strong>Objective :</strong>
            Understand an existing program and modify it to meet a specific need.
        </p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Reflective analysis</h2>

        <p>
            In this activity, I worked on an existing React application.
            I learned how to read and understand the structure of the source code.
        </p>

        <p>
            I executed the program locally in order to verify its behavior
            and observe how it works in the browser.
        </p>

        <p>
            I then modified some components to display custom data
            and improve the user interface.
        </p>

        <p>
            This activity helped me develop my ability to analyze existing code,
            fix errors, and adapt a program to a specific requirement.
        </p>

        <h2>Supporting documents</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Analyzed React source code</li>
            <li>Modifications of JSX components</li>
            <li>Local execution of the project</li>
            <li>Applied fixes and corrections</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Illustrative image</h2>
        <div style="text-align:center;">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/ac1302.png') }}" alt="AC13.02" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;">
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation buttons -->
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:30px;">

            <a href="{{ path('app_En_ac1301') }}" class="btn btn-primary">
                &laquo; Back - ac1301
            </a>

            <a href="{{ path('app_En_RT3') }}" class="btn btn-secondary">
                &laquo; Back - RT3 &raquo;
            </a>

            <a href="{{ path('app_En_ac1303') }}" class="btn btn-primary">
                Next – ac1303 &raquo;
            </a>

        </div>

    </div>
{% endblock %}
